      "message": "[vector-crypto] Clarifying relationship between Zvknhb and Zvknha\n\nThe current vector crypto specification does not mention any specific link between the two extensions.\nTheir respective description implies that Zvknhb is a subset of Zvknha.\nThis patch attempts at clarifying this relationship as simply as possible.",
      "tree": {
        "sha": "6650bb317e58f59378a2b7de700042d80c9720e4",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/riscv/riscv-isa-manual/git/trees/6650bb317e58f59378a2b7de700042d80c9720e4"
      },
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/riscv/riscv-isa-manual/git/commits/b2ed1ccba45fe07ed5ccc23624eb0f2da16ad1ed",
      "comment_count": 0,
      "verification": {
        "verified": true,
        "reason": "valid",
        "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQTic0I0c9pcZhs0Uj8nFwFEWgi1rAUCaYElGQAKCRAnFwFEWgi1\nrMHUAP9rQ2emVeSeiMfilTg/yC40WRU7mwM145lU4sbSs9nKPgEArQS2sTEL9EMn\nOAX2iBngrxZ+tUIrvjhU2sui5ZrdVgY=\n=o3Ic\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----",
        "payload": "tree 6650bb317e58f59378a2b7de700042d80c9720e4\nparent b9f1438191c25c95e877e521431f949990f8aa85\nauthor Nicolas Brunie <nibrunie@gmail.com> 1770005988 -0800\ncommitter Nicolas Brunie <nibrunie@gmail.com> 1770071319 -0800\n\n[vector-crypto] Clarifying relationship between Zvknhb and Zvknha\n\nThe current vector crypto specification does not mention any specific link between the two extensions.\nTheir respective description implies that Zvknhb is a subset of Zvknha.\nThis patch attempts at clarifying this relationship as simply as possible.\n",
        "verified_at": "2026-02-02T22:31:41Z"
      }
